AetherKit

Krea schedule and seeded-noise algorithms and their reference fixture values are
derived from the Apache-2.0 Aether prototype and its Aether / Atelier Swift
references. The retained prototype identifies upstream revision
7aff977df6e88005649b13bc63995f75eb4b217b.

Original Aether / Atelier sources are copyright their respective contributors.
The accompanying LICENSE preserves the Apache License, Version 2.0.

No model weights, tokenizer files, adapters or upstream Core AI Models runtime
implementation are distributed by this package. External assets retain their
own licenses.

H3 geometry, packing, row positions and scheduler conventions are derived from
Aether prototype sources and the pinned Diffusers behavior at commit
7ecb1e1b4fe500be7fb7381a7bb79a24d7fa3941, copyright 2026 The MiniMax and
HuggingFace Teams, licensed under Apache-2.0. The small CPU fixtures retain
original pipeline/oracle values, not model weights. Their source hashes and
scope are recorded in docs/evidence/h3-cpu-readiness-2026-10-18.json.

